      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "Opposite order."
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "The poor person wants to start pressure washing."
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Four hundred dollars for a machine."
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Credit card."
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Twenty-two percent interest."
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Zero customers."
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "But now there's a pressure washer in the garage."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "They feel like a business owner."
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "They didn't buy a pressure washer."
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "They bought a feeling."
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Two jobs come in."
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "One hundred fifty dollars each."
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Three hundred dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Then nothing."
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "The machine sits."
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "The payments don't."
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Eventually, they sell it for one hundred fifty dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "But they keep paying the card."
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Spread the purchase over twelve monthly payments, and that four hundred costs about four hundred fifty."
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Three hundred from customers."
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "One hundred fifty from selling the machine."
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Four hundred fifty in."
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Four hundred fifty out."
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Then forty dollars for fuel and supplies."
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Two jobs."
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "No machine left."
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "About forty dollars short."
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "The only one who made money was the credit card company."
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "They bought the equipment."
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "They never built the demand."
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "Here's what a rich person does before spending that four hundred."
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "First, they book the work."
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Two driveways."
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Same one hundred fifty dollars each."
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "The first purchase is a customer's decision to say yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Second, they rent."
    },
    {
      "id": "40",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Sixty dollars for one day, once the jobs are confirmed."
    },
    {
      "id": "41",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "They need the machine for the work — not for the garage."
    },
    {
      "id": "42",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Third, they put both jobs on that rental day."
    },
    {
      "id": "43",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Three hundred dollars in."
    },
    {
      "id": "44",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Sixty for the machine."
    },
    {
      "id": "45",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Forty for fuel and supplies."
    },
    {
      "id": "46",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Two hundred left before taxes and other overhead."
    },
    {
      "id": "47",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Same two jobs."
    },
    {
      "id": "48",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Same prices."
    },
    {
      "id": "49",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "Different equipment bill."
    },
    {
      "id": "50",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Fourth, with more work booked, they buy used."
    },
    {
      "id": "51",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "One hundred fifty dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "52",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Tested."
    },
    {
      "id": "53",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Working."
    },
    {
      "id": "54",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Cash."
    },
    {
      "id": "55",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "The machine the poor person just sold."
    },
    {
      "id": "56",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Now they've got a pressure washer and fifty dollars left from those first jobs."
    },
    {
      "id": "57",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "No card balance."
